      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this excellent three-bedroom semi-detached property with side entrance and large south-facing rear garden to the market, ideally located in the ever-popular Kilmore area of Dublin 5.\n\nNo. 17 offers bright and spacious accommodation throughout and comes to the market with huge potential for modernisation and extension, making it an ideal opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those looking to create a family home in a well-established residential location.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, spacious living room, fully fitted kitchen, and main family bathroom on the ground floor. Upstairs hosts three bedrooms one with fitted wardrobes. The property benefits from gas-fired central heating.\n\nOne of the standout features of this property is the large south-facing private rear garden, offering excellent potential for extension (subject to planning permission). To the front, the property benefits from a large driveway providing off-street parking as well as a side entrance.\n\nThe location is second to none with a wide range of local amenities nearby including schools, shops, Beaumont Hospital, Northside Shopping Centre, and excellent transport links to the City Centre, Dublin Airport, and M1/M50 motorways.\n\nThis property will appeal to a wide range of buyers and early viewing is highly recommended.\n\nKey Features\n• BER F\n• c.72sqm\n• 3-bedroom semi-detached property\n• Large front driveway\n• Side entrance\n• South-facing rear garden\n• Large private rear garden\n• Gas fired central heating\n• Fitted wardrobe\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Huge potential to extend (subject to planning permission)\n• Fantastic location\n• Ideal for first-time buyers and investors\n"
      },
      {
